# Windows

- Read `NOW.md` and `Windows/CONTEXT.md` before editing. Do not read root `CONTEXT.md`.
- Shared logic stays in `desktop-core`. Windows-only code stays in `Windows/`.
- The UI target is WinUI 3 / Fluent. The current shell is an interim egui app, not a CLI product.
- Phase 30 packaging is blocked on signing and the Windows App SDK. Do not claim a finished installer.
- Do not modify `android/` or the other platform roots during Windows work.
